# Neuron Deliver

When the user asks to **deliver**, **plan and build**, **build end-to-end**, **pick up a ticket**,
or start multi-file / UI / docs / polish / maintain work:

1. Follow the `neuron-deliver` skill — playbooks live **inside** deliver
2. `neuron_context` (`deep`); honor `present.codingAllowed`, `present.gate`, `present.deliver`
3. Clarify → `neuron_resolve_clarify` (clears `.neuron/workflow/gate.json`); prefer AskQuestion; do not code until gate clears (`codingAllowed` + Cursor best-effort hook)
4. After blueprint: `neuron_workflow` **propose_waves** then **complete_checklist**; board enforces `dependsOn` / `remembered` / `checklistDone`
5. Verify with Brain scripts; before done: `neuron_after_task` → `remembered: true`
6. Never auto-commit; never `.absolute-work/`

Skip the full loop for typos, renames, and one-line fixes.
